      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>With the body of a purple lion and the head and wings of an unusually colorful eagle, this majestic creature flies around the land hunting for its prey. - Imban</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 20, touch 12, flat-footed 17 (+2 Dex, +1 dodge, +8 natural, -1 size)</p><p>hp 76 [117] (9d10+27)</p><p>Fort +9, Ref +8, Will +6</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 30 ft., fly 80 ft. (Average)</p><p>Melee bite +13 (2d6+4), 2 talons +12 (1d6+4)</p><p>Space 10 ft.; Reach 5 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Level 3 Confuse, Peacock, pounce, rake (2 claws +12, 1d4+4)</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 18, Dex 15, Con 16, Int 6, Wis 16, Cha 10</p><p>Base Atk +9; CMB +14; CMD 26 (30 vs. trip)</p><p>Feats Dodge, Flyby Attack, Improved Natural Attack (Bite), Power Attack, Weapon Focus (Bite)</p><p>Skills Acrobatics +11, Fly +8, Perception +12; Racial Modifiers +4 Acrobatics, +4 Perception</p><h2>Ecology</h2><p>Environment warm islands</p><p>Organization solitary, pair, or pride (6-10)</p><p>Treasure incidental</p>"
